# Local development configuration. Copy to .env.development.local, which is git-ignored.
#
#   cp apps/web/.env.example apps/web/.env.development.local
#   pnpm web
#
# The filename matters. Vite loads `.env.local` in every mode, production builds included, so a
# value parked there would silently replace the Worker proxy in a deployed bundle. The
# `.development` infix restricts the file to `vite dev`, which is the only place it is correct.
#
# Nothing here is a secret and nothing here belongs in a deployment. Vite inlines every VITE_
# variable into the bundle, so a value with a credential in it would be public the moment it
# shipped. The one real secret, the upstream RPC URL, is a Worker secret and is set with
# `wrangler secret put SOLANA_RPC`. See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.

# Where the browser sends Solana reads.
#
# The deployment leaves this UNSET on purpose. Unset means the app calls `/rpc` on its own
# origin, which is the Cloudflare Worker proxy holding the paid credential server-side.
#
# `vite` serves no such route, so an unset value locally means every read 404s and the console
# renders empty. Local development therefore names a public endpoint directly. It is slower than
# the proxied one and it is the correct trade for a dev server.
#
# Do not export this variable in a shell that runs `pnpm --filter @vinct/web build`: it would
# bake a direct endpoint into a production bundle and bypass the proxy the architecture depends
# on.
VITE_SOLANA_RPC=https://api.devnet.solana.com

# Optional. Each already defaults to the value shown, in apps/web/src/lib/network.ts.
# Uncomment only to point local development somewhere else.
#
# Account scans go direct from the browser rather than through the proxy, because paid tiers
# commonly decline getProgramAccounts and the public endpoint blocks datacentre addresses.
# VITE_SOLANA_SCAN_RPC=https://api.devnet.solana.com
#
# A first candidate only. resolveRuntime asks the router what actually exists and refuses to
# guess when the two disagree, so no regional rollup is ever hardcoded.
# VITE_MAGICBLOCK_ER=https://devnet-us.magicblock.app/
# VITE_MAGICBLOCK_ROUTER=https://devnet-router.magicblock.app/
